        "reply_settings": "everyone",
        "text": "每日一诗104\n\nTime seems much faster,\nThan my imagination,\nWhen I reached the end.\nBut as for ones far away from it,\nIt slows down and distresses them,\nKeeps them suffering.\nHeaven is a place nearby,\nWhy must we be urgent?"
